# Mutation plan for `GET /api/v4/system/notices/{team_id}` — the notice cache and matcher.
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/sysops-notices.plan
#
# Every line is a decision `parity::sysops::the_product_notices_match_for_a_viewer_and_a_fresh_user`
# has a row for: the viewed check, the hard-coded English message, the client-version parse
# that runs whether or not a range needs it, the server-version and audience checks the feed's
# fifteen notices exercise, the config-entry type rule, and the two semver operators the feed
# uses. One no-op control closes the plan.

